 "_doc": "Rules are evaluated in order against the lower-cased text '<event title> || <market question> || <groupItemTitle>'. The first rule whose `any` pattern matches, whose `all` patterns all match, and none of whose `none` patterns match, assigns the category. Every assignment records the rule id so classification is auditable. Manual overrides in overrides.json win over rules. Rules with \"skip\": true drop the market from tracking entirely (e.g. speech-mention markets, non-US macro). Rules are re-applied to every stored market at each analyze run, so rule changes take effect retroactively.",
